-joes-first-car-2019-03-19-23-56-09/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Joe asks his dad to help him.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/10-joes-first-car-2019-03-19-23-56-09/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Joe and his dad make a deal.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/10-joes-first-car-2019-03-19-23-56-09/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Joe's dad will lend him the money.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/10-joes-first-car-2019-03-19-23-56-09/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Joe must work hard.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/10-joes-first-car-2019-03-19-23-56-09/18.mp3"},{"answer":"He must pay the money back to his dad.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/10-joes-first-car-2019-03-19-23-56-09/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Joe is very happy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/10-joes-first-car-2019-03-19-23-56-09/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Joe owns his first car.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/10-joes-first-car-2019-03-19-23-56-09/21.mp3"}]
